{"sha": "6f0eb540b13b69ac6a181cdd13063476ee95515c22a374fe4bd512ab758b1937", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=6.4cm, height=6.4cm,", "    xmin=-2.3, xmax=2.3, ymin=-2.3, ymax=2.3,", "    xtick={-1,1}, ytick={-1,1}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:360, samples=90, smooth]", "    ({cos(x)}, {-sin(x)});", "  \\addplot[omDef!60, thick, domain=0:360, samples=90, smooth]", "    ({1.7*cos(x)}, {-1.7*sin(x)});", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (axis cs:1,0) -- (axis cs:0.995,-0.12);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (axis cs:1.7,0) -- (axis cs:1.695,-0.12);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\hspace{6mm}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=6.4cm, height=6.4cm,", "    xmin=-2.3, xmax=2.3, ymin=-2.3, ymax=2.3,", "    xtick={-1,1}, ytick={-1,1}]", "  % A = diag(-1,-2)-type stable node: trajectories y = c x^2", "  \\addplot[omMeth, thick, domain=-1.5:1.5, samples=60] {x^2};", "  \\addplot[omMeth, thick, domain=-1.5:1.5, samples=60] {-x^2};", "  \\addplot[omMeth, thick, domain=-2.2:2.2, samples=2] {0};", "  \\addplot[omMeth!60, thick, domain=-1.2:1.2, samples=60] {2*x^2};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (axis cs:1.2,1.44) --", "    (axis cs:1.05,1.1);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (axis cs:-1.2,-1.44) --", "    (axis cs:-1.05,-1.1);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 两个线性相图。左：\\emph{中心}", "（特征值 $\\pm\\iu$） --- 调和振子的闭合圆轨道。", "右：\\emph{稳定结点}（特征值 $-1, -2$） ---", "所有轨道沿慢", "特征方向相切地落入原点。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=9.6cm, height=6.4cm,", "    xmin=-3.2, xmax=3.2, ymin=-1.6, ymax=2.6,", "    xtick={0}, ytick={0},", "    xlabel={$\\tau = \\operatorname{tr}A$},", "    ylabel={$\\delta = \\det A$}]", "  \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=-3:3, samples=100]", "    {x^2/4};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omThm] at (axis cs:2.45,2.1)", "    {$\\delta = \\tau^2/4$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:0,-0.9) {鞍点};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:-2.45,0.7)", "    {稳定结点};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:2.45,0.7)", "    {不稳定结点};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:-1.05,1.9)", "    {稳定焦点};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:1.05,1.9)", "    {不稳定焦点};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omDef] at (axis cs:0,2.35) {中心};", "  \\draw[omDef, very thick] (axis cs:0,0) -- (axis cs:0,2.55);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $X' = AX$ 在 $2$ 维情形下的迹--行列式平面：", "水平轴下方为鞍点；水平轴与抛物线 $\\delta = \\tau^2/4$ 之间为结点；", "抛物线内部为焦点；", "正 $\\delta$ 轴上为中心。周末问题证明了这一分类，", "并沿其中一条竖直线 --- 阻尼振子 ---", "考察其进入共振的过程。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[应用]", "线性系统是处理一切非线性问题的局部模型：", "在平衡点附近，光滑向量场（在双曲情形下）的行为", "与其线性化的行为一致，其相图由迹--行列式", "平面刻画。周末问题完整地讨论了振子的故事 ---", "阻尼、受迫、共振，以及变系数情形下的", "施图姆比较定理 ---", "这正是减震器、交流电路与", "谱隙背后共同的数学。本科三年级分册", "将在流形上回到定性理论（流、稳定性、", "首次积分）。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{变系数的二阶方程}", "", "\\begin{proposition}\\label{prop:b2:diffeq:secondorder}", "方程 $y'' + a(t)y' + b(t)y = c(t)$（$a, b, c$ 在 $I$ 上连续）", "等价于系统 $X' = A(t)X + B(t)$，其中 $X = (y, y')$：", "在整个 $I$ 上解存在且唯一，初值 $(y(t_0),", "y'(t_0))$ 可任意给定；齐次解构成一个平面。若已知一个", "处处不为零的齐次解 $y_1$，则可通过\\emph{降阶}求出与之独立的", "第二个解：令 $y = y_1 z$，齐次方程化为关于 $z'$ 的", "一阶方程，", "再由求积分法解出。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由系统形式及\\cref{thm:b2:diffeq:linear}", "即可得到全部结构性结论。降阶：代入 $y = y_1z$，", "\\[", "y_1 z'' + (2y_1' + a y_1)z' + \\underbrace{(y_1'' + ay_1' +", "by_1)}_{=\\,0}\\,z = 0 :", "\\]", "这是关于 $u = z'$ 的一阶线性方程，可由本科一年级的", "公式解出；对 $u$ 积分得 $z$，从而 $y_2 = y_1 z$，", "它与 $y_1$ 独立，只要 $z$ 非常数。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:b2:diffeq:lowering}", "$t^2y'' - 2y = 0$ 在 $\\intoo{0}{\\infty}$ 上：$y_1 = t^2$ 是一个", "解。令 $y = t^2z$，由 $y' = t^2z' + 2tz$ 及 $y''", "= t^2z'' + 4tz' + 2z$，得", "\\[", "t^2y'' - 2y = t^4 z'' + 4t^3z' = 0,", "\\qquad\\text{即}\\qquad \\frac{z''}{z'} = -\\frac4t :", "\\]", "$z' = t^{-4}$（相差一个常数），$z = -\\frac{1}{3t^3}$，于是 $y_2", "= t^2z = -\\frac{1}{3t}$。通解为 $y = \\alpha t^2 +", "\\frac{\\beta}{t}$。", "\\end{example}", ""]}